            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="facility-card">
                    <div class="facility-icon-wrap">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">24/7 Dedicated Butler</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                        From unpacking your luggage to arranging private yacht charters, your bespoke butler is always at your command.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                <div class="facility-card">
                    <div class="facility-icon-wrap">
                        <i class="bi bi-wifi"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">High-Speed Wi-Fi & Media</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                        Seamless enterprise fiber-optic connectivity, smart room integration, and international multimedia channels.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

